{"id":"eternidad","lemma":"eternidad","pos":"noun","rank":2671,"glosses":["eternity"],"ipa":"/eteɾniˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"eternidades"},"order":2679,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/02/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-eternidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esto está llevando una eternidad.","en":"This is taking forever.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/103183","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"No te he visto hace una eternidad.","en":"I haven't seen you for ages.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"seen"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Me hicieron esperar una eternidad.","en":"I was kept waiting for an eternity.","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to hope"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}